                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "SAMA weekly point-of-sale statistics, via the KAPSARC data portal. 270 weeks, 10 May 2020 to 12 Jul 2025. Ramadan and Eid dates: the Umm al-Qura calendar.",
